  "releaseNotes": "2.4.0: IAuditService now accepts an optional sourceReference on the user overloads of LogCreate/LogUpdate/LogDelete/LogRelated, and AuditService persists it (sets it on new AuditLog rows and refreshes it on existing ones). This lets the Dapper path populate SourceReference, matching the EF interceptor behavior. 2.3.1: Republish bump of 2.3.0 (version-only change). 2.3.0: SourceReference column widened to 512 chars; BREAKING: existing AuditLog tables must ALTER SourceReference to width >= 512.",
